# Task: Troubleshooting Git Commit Issue

- [ ] Check git status and staged files <!-- id: 0 -->
- [ ] Check for existence of .git/index.lock <!-- id: 1 -->
- [ ] Identify if large files (e.g., videos) are causing the hang <!-- id: 2 -->
- [ ] Attempt commit from terminal to identify error messages <!-- id: 3 -->
- [ ] Fix the issue (remove lock file, unstage large files, etc.) <!-- id: 4 -->
